omize your character. Change your look and make underground exploration even more fun.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Version 1.0 Legacy Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Version 1.0 remains playable. Select Legacy Mode from the title screen to enjoy the previous version of Keep Digging. Version 2.0 and Version 1.0 use separate save data, so you can play either version whenever you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585800/extras/3b578974a4b8da8e22bc7d6a31679582.poster.avif?t=1777355505\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585800/extras/3b578974a4b8da8e22bc7d6a31679582.webm?t=1777355505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585800/extras/3b578974a4b8da8e22bc7d6a31679582.mp4?t=1777355505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Keep Digging is a digging survival craft game for up to 8 players. Explore a procedurally generated 5000m underground world, bring back ores, blueprints, and fossils, then use the smelter, forge, and enchantments to build your gear! Team up in co-op or compete for items in PvP.", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, German, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585800/fa3971aab9b22af494e4ab0b3790d9bcb89dae71/header.jpg?t=1777355505", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585800/b983c72b34293d9ca390066178ed481110769812/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1777355505", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585800/b983c72b34293d9ca390066178ed481110769812/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1777355505", "website": "https://wilddog.jp/keepdigging", "pc_requir